<title>BURKINA FASO: SOCCER-GUINEA BEAT BURKINA FASO 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUINEA BEAT BURKINA FASO 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>OUAGADOUGOU 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinea beat Burkina Faso 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a World Cup African zone, group one qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Souleymane Oulare 16 Momo Wendel 43</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
